orgwebalchemy (1.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Relicensed under the MIT License: COPYING becomes LICENSE and every
    source header carries SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT.
  * New module (orgwebalchemy json), with org->json, org-ast->json,
    inline-org->json and json-string.
  * New link-protocols parameter, so a host application resolves its own
    link protocols.
  * Source, homepages and CI move to GitHub.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

